:''Not to be confused with [[:Category:Typeless Enemies|Typeless Enemies]].''
'''Traitless Enemies''' (属性を持たない敵 ''Zokusei o Motanai Teki''), also known as '''White Enemies''' (白い敵 ''Shiroi Teki''), are the first type of [[:Category:Enemy Units|Enemy Unit]] found in-game. Their body is usually white-gray colored. As their name suggests, Traitless enemies belong to their own category, and do not have any traits ([[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]], [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]], etc.); they can, however, be [[:Category:Colossus Enemies|Colossus]], [[:Category:Behemoth Enemies|Behemoth]], [[:Category:Sage Enemies|Sage]] or [[:Category:Kaijin Enemies|Kaijin]], which aren't considered traits. Their stats are extremely varied, and do not follow any patterns. Despite being the first type of enemy encountered, Traitless enemies can be some of the hardest to deal with, due to the relative scarcity of [[:Category:Anti-Traitless Cats|anti-Traitless Cats]].

Most [[:Category:Enemy Cats|Enemy Cats]] are Traitless, though there are exceptions.

==Trivia==
*Traitless is the most abundant type in the game, with over 300 enemies as of {{CurrentVer}}.
*Many [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]], [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] and [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] enemies were originally also Traitless. The Traitless/Floating enemies were changed in [[Version 5.10 Update|Version 5.10]], which added the first cat to specifically be [[:Category:Anti-Traitless Cats|anti-Traitless]] ([[Shadow Gao (Uber Rare Cat)|Shadow Gao]]), while the Traitless/Red and Traitless/Dark enemies seem to have been changed some time afterwards.
**Traitless/Floating: [[The Face]], [[Mooth]], [[Teacher Bun Bun]], [[Owlbrow]], [[Yurinchi (Enemy)|Yurinchi]], [[Princess Head]], [[White Cyclone]], [[Crazed Bird Cat (Enemy)|Crazed Bird Cat]], [[Beefcake Cat (Enemy)|Beefcake Cat]], [[Flying Ninja Cat (Enemy)|Flying Ninja Cat]], [[Manic Flying Cat (Enemy)|Manic Flying Cat]]
**Traitless/Red: [[Pigge Back]], [[Sho Ayanokoji (Enemy)|Sho Ayanokoji]]
**Traitless/Dark: [[Gory Groom]]
*Traitless, [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] and [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] are the only standard enemy types without [[Fruit Treasures]].
**Traitless is the only one without [[Talent Orbs]] that can be obtained; sprites for Traitless Talent Orbs have been in the game data since [[Version 9.7 Update|Version 9.7]], but are currently unused.

